00:10:07,613 --> 00:10:10,365
What do I need to remember?

139
00:10:10,900 --> 00:10:15,362
--read-only prevents any change to the container's file system:

140
00:10:15,362 --> 00:10:18,550
code, configuration and binaries stay intact.

141
00:10:19,100 --> 00:10:27,210
Find what an application writes with docker diff; give it --tmpfs (scratch) or volumes (data).

